# the engine picker offers only the kept engines (synth.h eg_offered: rayon, jacquard, sample, kit, MIDI out), whether
# EDIT is held with ALGORITHM or SEL's ENGINE row is turned; the cut ones (knit, bellows, cane, voile, acid, slice) are
# skipped. Engine numbers: rayon 1, jacquard 2, sample 6, kit 8, MIDI 9
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
expect par2.0 2
tap EDIT
press EDIT
turn ALGO 1
expect par2.0 6
turn ALGO 1
expect par2.0 8
turn ALGO 1
expect par2.0 9
turn ALGO 1
expect par2.0 9
turn ALGO -1
expect par2.0 8
turn ALGO -1
expect par2.0 6
turn ALGO -1
expect par2.0 2
turn ALGO -1
expect par2.0 1
turn ALGO -1
expect par2.0 1
release EDIT
# SEL's list: ENGINE moves the same way (from rayon up one: jacquard; two more: the sample player, knit and the rest skipped)
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 1
tap SEL
wait 50
expect par2.0 2
tap SEL
row ENGINE
turn ALGO 1
tap SEL
wait 50
expect par2.0 6
